  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The common joke against the Christmas number is that it is planned in July and made up in September.",
      "output_sha256": "f5e10b50906ad323e8e9c639112a76fba40d6cb3a942fa7cda804a309f7d6b1c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "f5e10b50906ad323e8e9c639112a76fba40d6cb3a942fa7cda804a309f7d6b1c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This planning allows for its release in mid-November, ensuring that it reaches New Zealand in time for Christmas.",
      "output_sha256": "d58dde8335058acd1221dd8609038ccfa24e3d34d66a0352e5dce98ed03500fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.435,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c1799637a981e6111e9580d0fc4556ba81b99f7659ea1d6e5483cd40b5f85a45"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d58dde8335058acd1221dd8609038ccfa24e3d34d66a0352e5dce98ed03500fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If it were to be published in England during the holiday season, New Zealand would have to wait until February for its arrival.",
      "output_sha256": "3025a8497dd41efb693efe927e525ba239b4c2aac5a7e90273406c95bdb27f53",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.479009,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9c326baf063297c3b846ddf337012cc378a2b2b47b0004c48c7140ce62c0b7d6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3025a8497dd41efb693efe927e525ba239b4c2aac5a7e90273406c95bdb27f53",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Apparently, it is deemed more crucial for the colonies to receive their copies punctually than for those in England to have theirs.",
      "output_sha256": "cecca5112a05d53107decfbaad6157d389384cdf7dcb163630ec088fc37ea438",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.467071,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3d6d8929e36020feee0a7112f0ea7c6977484d741ecd661e4b8d9072ea04151e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cecca5112a05d53107decfbaad6157d389384cdf7dcb163630ec088fc37ea438",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Anyway, whenever it is made up, all journalists hate the Christmas number.",
      "output_sha256": "dfc09c1853fd2754bfe9a3ac46ace868ec6e47e690144d35faf3485f05b8a20d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "dfc09c1853fd2754bfe9a3ac46ace868ec6e47e690144d35faf3485f05b8a20d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But they only hate it for one reason—this being that the ordinary weekly number has to be made up at the same time.",
      "output_sha256": "bb635375c3a26b779e95805166509aeec70f8781d1f23031c842fb4267954bee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb635375c3a26b779e95805166509aeec70f8781d1f23031c842fb4267954bee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As a journalist I should like to devote the autumn exclusively to the Christmas number, and as a member of the public I should adore it when it came out.",
      "output_sha256": "3e4770ce92fc29553903127e14948b2932401bddb959461a66b7b0142ca421c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e4770ce92fc29553903127e14948b2932401bddb959461a66b7b0142ca421c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Not having been asked to produce such a number on my own I can amuse myself here by sketching out a plan for it.",
      "output_sha256": "d1f8fff3269030039b6bd8f3225312db4143f938e13b1844fcdca459c7bd8f8b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1f8fff3269030039b6bd8f3225312db4143f938e13b1844fcdca459c7bd8f8b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I adhere to the cherished tradition of storytelling.",
      "output_sha256": "8a6a5f9331b43a9648143671eff3c9f0f70389c04a0343101b74ad88ca76bb1f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.410714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "24af0b91ee52031aadd07208f4274db220570a93c2d56f230877d2320f8e1daa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8a6a5f9331b43a9648143671eff3c9f0f70389c04a0343101b74ad88ca76bb1f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Let’s start with the first narrative.",
      "output_sha256": "1f0b3de0e95c4f62271b73ec49e011b6bcb630b8f4db3d11e792a87a5add5fb5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.273993,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "739910ffbc7dd7cbc0eed3bae7de76cb05ab00753984f1fd49ba4523a40db64a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1f0b3de0e95c4f62271b73ec49e011b6bcb630b8f4db3d11e792a87a5add5fb5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The opening story revolves around an escaped convict.",
      "output_sha256": "c1f12f4290050b321c93fd0618b6a7c681755755c641722c41d95fe101a239c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.46875,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9b70a15f7485b263e1949f8d5187dc5166262785f899b90a109de186a8e269e7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c1f12f4290050b321c93fd0618b6a7c681755755c641722c41d95fe101a239c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The heroine is driving back from the country- house ball, where she has had two or three proposals, when suddenly, in the most lonely part of the snow-swept moor, a figure springs out of the ditch and covers the coachman with a pistol.",
      "output_sha256": "c8b52cb2300b82db4cb9e4afbd5c6de7a4b5152ef6c6b1155926f1c155e55b31",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "c8b52cb2300b82db4cb9e4afbd5c6de7a4b5152ef6c6b1155926f1c155e55b31",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Alarms and confusions.",
      "output_sha256": "727104e666ec08e0629d13c6cb768bf81382942074e61fa4969ec6f0853d19f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "727104e666ec08e0629d13c6cb768bf81382942074e61fa4969ec6f0853d19f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Oh, sir,\" says the heroine, \"spare my aunt and I will give you all my jewels.\"",
      "output_sha256": "f405fed8956f982b18c6c66008e84b4fb6025a93eeab05b45ddbcf944840d426",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "f405fed8956f982b18c6c66008e84b4fb6025a93eeab05b45ddbcf944840d426",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The convict, for such it is, staggers back.",
      "output_sha256": "7fe36b8c20c412177dc55750c0803acd47c819543f87ab8496af124ca21be330",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "7fe36b8c20c412177dc55750c0803acd47c819543f87ab8496af124ca21be330",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Lucy!\" he cries.",
      "output_sha256": "983c0f90af95d6a41f1075427cb4dcf9278024d29af38b0bdc4270bf90011fef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "983c0f90af95d6a41f1075427cb4dcf9278024d29af38b0bdc4270bf90011fef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Harold!\" she gasps.",
      "output_sha256": "8fa8985d3668964376933f853371cccf59c93bd4b4576db0ed7b0dffd594e5e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "8fa8985d3668964376933f853371cccf59c93bd4b4576db0ed7b0dffd594e5e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The aunt, overwhelmed by the drama, faints.",
      "output_sha256": "ce8520c37f9f199e3c93425c7292355b252f8e147607c4c3ac1ffa8c1552339b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.387857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "242c57553eccd808ffd1506cf5cb5064e77771cf116313cb478865fc93c53dff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ce8520c37f9f199e3c93425c7292355b252f8e147607c4c3ac1ffa8c1552339b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "At this point the story stops to explain how Harold came to be in knickerbockers.",
      "output_sha256": "f793a7a8a0b716ab2fd6772d6bf8318dd9ca186192c2d8ee611909a8005ab53f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "f793a7a8a0b716ab2fd6772d6bf8318dd9ca186192c2d8ee611909a8005ab53f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He had either been falsely accused or else he had been a solicitor.",
      "output_sha256": "2f810274f3757485e1c742ad9da4e96caa862ab749200b201d981c8e78160dba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f810274f3757485e1c742ad9da4e96caa862ab749200b201d981c8e78160dba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Anyhow, he had by this time more than paid for his folly, and Lucy still loved him.",
      "output_sha256": "84a8f078f3427b41c6955cdf7f1703b0e859dc83fcadf68bba4caf372ed38703",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "84a8f078f3427b41c6955cdf7f1703b0e859dc83fcadf68bba4caf372ed38703",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Get in,” she insists, and they drive away together, with Harold departing for New Zealand the following day in a standard lounge suit.",
      "output_sha256": "713ea77537bf1d91259c1939a40ebf6bb057bd563132009c6d61ca7b8fd3e6b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.49893,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aeb2027fedbc81ce72277296dc04b83c390c82e16ae850ab4b9221cd6317decd",
        "313d45b85abe87fd3bc0d845d80a5ec5092fa1c6851bdbd205fcfdff9a8fa8a4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "713ea77537bf1d91259c1939a40ebf6bb057bd563132009c6d61ca7b8fd3e6b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As for Lucy joining him later, that conclusion is left to your imagination.",
      "output_sha256": "588b4a7b1b6fc6acfa7e3cf4d6a4b7707c1a567ac1e94e27c8b2ede5ea7e5020",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.517241,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "092dc0ad649bda1c429bf1f51646607856caf81e87612d5e4dc4e1ddbdc864e4",
        "e6fef4e701a826bd8650ec8d9123c5a81e37ee5c9c09c2e5e8f00a5dc05dd08c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "588b4a7b1b6fc6acfa7e3cf4d6a4b7707c1a567ac1e94e27c8b2ede5ea7e5020",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The End.",
      "output_sha256": "c10d6238791b38a0bee0a734c2b0730781cb749890c6ee21345cd37fa9d8d71f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "c10d6238791b38a0bee0a734c2b0730781cb749890c6ee21345cd37fa9d8d71f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So much for the first story.",
      "output_sha256": "a04a14e2bd6e6cb9268586952dd85e1656da022d9c11afd9369286f61720af17",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "a04a14e2bd6e6cb9268586952dd85e1656da022d9c11afd9369286f61720af17",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The second is an \"i'-faith-and-stap- me\" story of the good old days.",
      "output_sha256": "42185aaa845558cc96983bc10c102ccde4dfde7b9031a142f162ef14e09a8f98",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "42185aaa845558cc96983bc10c102ccde4dfde7b9031a142f162ef14e09a8f98",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is not seasonable, for most of the action takes place in my lord's garden amid the scent of roses; but it brings back to us the old romantic days when fighting and swearing were more picturesque than they are now, and when women loved and worked samplers.",
      "output_sha256": "88f766f078e6bc8e306936906d3b5606115bd734a97537b892d84ec86ed5dd80",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "88f766f078e6bc8e306936906d3b5606115bd734a97537b892d84ec86ed5dd80",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This sort of story can be read best in front of the Christmas log; it is of the past, and comes naturally into a Christmas number.",
      "output_sha256": "28504d61586d1f01cef2f8e3b796a6643ff369adca48e5659d04de4c9be43b36",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "28504d61586d1f01cef2f8e3b796a6643ff369adca48e5659d04de4c9be43b36",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I shall not describe its plot, for that is unimportant; it is the \"stap me's\" and the \"la, sirs,\" which matter.",
      "output_sha256": "6e0237f19bdb2c1c5a205d716d1b1fb54b52f161b92b46cc0c944329ec371c9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "6e0237f19bdb2c1c5a205d716d1b1fb54b52f161b92b46cc0c944329ec371c9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, I can reveal that the couple does marry in the end, and he embarks on his adventures in the military with a joyful heart.",
      "output_sha256": "4b33ed04167d0648ad22eec435f7f6a09b6e18ff49c520346dba3b041df420a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.338158,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5732c0d98dc0d69e96a3e9c1c05a1359a0614dd17c445981f6a59a9f13cb42ff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4b33ed04167d0648ad22eec435f7f6a09b6e18ff49c520346dba3b041df420a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We want another story.",
      "output_sha256": "c2678e6ee95c9f7afc4b4b10ca490946816ca7e0ab764522abf69b5b36b8a71d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "c2678e6ee95c9f7afc4b4b10ca490946816ca7e0ab764522abf69b5b36b8a71d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "What theme should this one explore?",
      "output_sha256": "03a1d6113bdd76741067fa909f9ab303eb56e52b3b84f315ecf3fce009bdb607",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.560714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4fe84163d339526162d7aa84ea041cec4dac4536d9c9d7196e7c1848d8249377"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "03a1d6113bdd76741067fa909f9ab303eb56e52b3b84f315ecf3fce009bdb607",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It might be about the amateur burglar, or the little child who reconciled old Sir John to his daughter's marriage, or the ghost at Enderby Grange, or the millionaire's Christmas dinner, or the accident to the Scotch express.",
      "output_sha256": "fd925b63448510719bd6a528a192f18091fe4fd735a3d2cab3edec7f45d508f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "fd925b63448510719bd6a528a192f18091fe4fd735a3d2cab3edec7f45d508f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Personally, none of these resonate with me; I favor the story set on a deserted island.",
      "output_sha256": "fc9c2539cb93fef2d12432739a6c21f348d20b0f7903aea1eba57b6eee2f0abb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.450625,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c7ddc3a93f555923971c5bb744cc68a785a1afe37a64e7730d0665d2c0a938e1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fc9c2539cb93fef2d12432739a6c21f348d20b0f7903aea1eba57b6eee2f0abb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Proud Lady Julia has fallen off the deck of the liner, and Ronald, refused by her that morning, dives off the hurricane deck—or the bowsprit or wherever he happens to be—and seizes her as she is sinking for the third time.",
      "output_sha256": "cabbf4ef155f4f0a3c9f78d2e9a9b5b88309a36c47943dac61a20bec0d6f40a3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "cabbf4ef155f4f0a3c9f78d2e9a9b5b88309a36c47943dac61a20bec0d6f40a3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is a foggy night and their absence is unnoticed.",
      "output_sha256": "5102297bbf32df477c49f98473bbe45d679dbc18c1a2f9f818ee68dafa40f36a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "5102297bbf32df477c49f98473bbe45d679dbc18c1a2f9f818ee68dafa40f36a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Dawn finds them together on a little coral reef.",
      "output_sha256": "027f41b09ebc961c4e0760bd253d3da8342678f41a1fc1cbb4813c9b280ee78b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "027f41b09ebc961c4e0760bd253d3da8342678f41a1fc1cbb4813c9b280ee78b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They are in no danger, for several liners are due to pass in a day or two and Ronald's pockets are full of biscuits and chocolate, but it is awkward for Lady Julia, who had hoped that they would never meet again.",
      "output_sha256": "c7484b148cf44763c927938a7af21d7b08b6c920da9d062323fe05a5e46f6934",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "c7484b148cf44763c927938a7af21d7b08b6c920da9d062323fe05a5e46f6934",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Thus, they sit back to back on the beach, exchanging sarcastic remarks.",
      "output_sha256": "aa28bc328701822db34d43baff2f3dd0153da91f1adfc5a6a81ac903ff9d20a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.384348,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "911b689310375a48e8075f7db7b974000e9b62f0ac25d685666b25703a6cc769"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aa28bc328701822db34d43baff2f3dd0153da91f1adfc5a6a81ac903ff9d20a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In the end he tames her proud spirit—I think by hiding the turtles' eggs from her—and the next liner but one takes the happy couple back to civilization.",
      "output_sha256": "6a1e64beabbe92e5be235d3602234aa1ec7cd26b114ec0ec9ae30dd93e6b887d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a1e64beabbe92e5be235d3602234aa1ec7cd26b114ec0ec9ae30dd93e6b887d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But it is time we had some poetry.",
      "output_sha256": "2a866909cf20652050b88bf067e74b1fbeab86355bcf45325f5fdb17203f692c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a866909cf20652050b88bf067e74b1fbeab86355bcf45325f5fdb17203f692c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I propose to include one serious poem focused on robins, accompanied by a whimsical double-page illustration of humorous verses.",
      "output_sha256": "6ad00e1ca7a63d2aa101b53e33c0ab01ea28942664f0d0a94d89c1b771af0007",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.548684,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2a08a3d54a905191c7666cfb1a3a490593dd8251b02c6a859a3f52d26212618a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6ad00e1ca7a63d2aa101b53e33c0ab01ea28942664f0d0a94d89c1b771af0007",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I think the humorous verses must deal with hunting.",
      "output_sha256": "1350e344053b1b9a397fe5064203e60ac131464a14a178bcac76552d76df99f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "1350e344053b1b9a397fe5064203e60ac131464a14a178bcac76552d76df99f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Hunting does not lend itself to humour, for there are only two hunting jokes —the joke of the horse which came down at the brook and the joke of the Cockney who overrode hounds; but there are traditions to keep up, and the artist always loves it.",
      "output_sha256": "af44066d9372f9a1ecc9da600d3ef85acf3709a47a057fff64e79a60fa371bf2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "af44066d9372f9a1ecc9da600d3ef85acf3709a47a057fff64e79a60fa371bf2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Thus far, we haven’t given enough thought to the artist’s contributions.",
      "output_sha256": "99de98820d0f4d8c4b56c10996603d8bbce2059f9e1ea26da00ae4f4d78c69d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.325909,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "97a721ad207814e201b55d037257678627475acca32782d67d69568e37c89655"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "99de98820d0f4d8c4b56c10996603d8bbce2059f9e1ea26da00ae4f4d78c69d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Let us give him four full pages.",
      "output_sha256": "c4596d44cc240ccce9a827540f20c0a15cae16ad3f21cfd3ef4cd5845ca29753",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "c4596d44cc240ccce9a827540f20c0a15cae16ad3f21cfd3ef4cd5845ca29753",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "One of pretty girls hanging up mistletoe, one of the squire and his family going to church in the snow, one of a brokendown coach with highwaymen coming over the hill, and one of the postman bringing loads and loads of parcels.",
      "output_sha256": "3bf56d62beef4c3f8db500bfeb041e2fa9f4abbe165dc40a3b9ce088d10116a4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "3bf56d62beef4c3f8db500bfeb041e2fa9f4abbe165dc40a3b9ce088d10116a4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Together, these four images encapsulate the essence of Christmas.",
      "output_sha256": "8a3094456a9a173b84bf45fd772af3e3af60660e07d373e1596cd566ff5561a3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.307386,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "33d3002de45fccbaaffffabcb39a624475b7ad6a441e1d2c64b4a005c4c3ff59"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8a3094456a9a173b84bf45fd772af3e3af60660e07d373e1596cd566ff5561a3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, there is space for one more page—a color page filled with a handful of sketches, styled in early English lettering.",
      "output_sha256": "668d093c61e9873656f761ff26f54b7a50b1974d6691d18efc29680cd304345b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.444826,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fcad5e87201f81c3cdb302d2cf3dd327e1814058313eed4ddd2df35ba6e69b45"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "668d093c61e9873656f761ff26f54b7a50b1974d6691d18efc29680cd304345b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Ye Baron de Marchebankes calleth for hys varlet.\"",
      "output_sha256": "62c07390c3ae02f7c3607a658c344fae83320fd1518c355d76f9f19d0f18cf83",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "62c07390c3ae02f7c3607a658c344fae83320fd1518c355d76f9f19d0f18cf83",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Ye varlet cometh righte hastilie—-\" You know the delightful kind of thing.",
      "output_sha256": "a04af33edaf38a57ed390d99441cce9f34bce18cd069c0e3f4abc53bf6b5bd3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "a04af33edaf38a57ed390d99441cce9f34bce18cd069c0e3f4abc53bf6b5bd3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I confess that this is the sort of Christmas number which I love.",
      "output_sha256": "b1f4d65a3963ca3e9ba0d7d4589ba0111ee0b2d5cb7f65900e17c0d374e03f5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1f4d65a3963ca3e9ba0d7d4589ba0111ee0b2d5cb7f65900e17c0d374e03f5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You may say that you have seen it all before; I say that that is why I love it.",
      "output_sha256": "cb042d214c55d82a097f74a21d57e7648315ebdd971c9bc979c51255d37c2e54",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "cb042d214c55d82a097f74a21d57e7648315ebdd971c9bc979c51255d37c2e54",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The best of Christmas is that it reminds us of other Christmases; it should be the boast of Christmas numbers that they remind us of other Christmas numbers.",
      "output_sha256": "2136071fe57f3dbc5242b2b73fb69d71abffe5a5b06a569ea9dea70e640dd685",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "2136071fe57f3dbc5242b2b73fb69d71abffe5a5b06a569ea9dea70e640dd685",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Although I remain skeptical about receiving everything I desire from any single publication this year, I am confident that the collective offerings will adequately evoke the spirit of Christmas.",
      "output_sha256": "2ff6f0f5f921483e77b91530fcda81fa2c5eeba7191fded7955679739c49e38c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.333162,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1f03040b69e06d626505ba3afa28de37a864a173a2ba2c00a31da8280a7e3ae4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2ff6f0f5f921483e77b91530fcda81fa2c5eeba7191fded7955679739c49e38c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In a dull November one likes to be reminded that Christmas is coming.",
      "output_sha256": "c970ae83c22eb20b81bd75907f95d21193bebba25088863b2172a1445361fbf0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "c970ae83c22eb20b81bd75907f95d21193bebba25088863b2172a1445361fbf0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is perhaps as well that the demands of the colonies give us our Christmas numbers so early.",
      "output_sha256": "0f8c7943548c5a7de88036e53f8beef43f5b518c2779670a1d78cab4b8d14800",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "0f8c7943548c5a7de88036e53f8beef43f5b518c2779670a1d78cab4b8d14800",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, I find it perplexing why New Zealand requires a Christmas edition at all.",
      "output_sha256": "2d6e447173475b27df7404c1c0a55ef0560ee63ae4b27d17f8ffcc11c67195fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.504306,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0eceaf55d5c1a5ee41dc671d497eb7802cd15f502253cba2b67a06e120032ae6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d6e447173475b27df7404c1c0a55ef0560ee63ae4b27d17f8ffcc11c67195fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As I reflect on the blueprint of my ideal magazine, I am increasingly aware of how delightful it would be—but, oh, certainly not with the thermometer soaring to a hundred degrees in the shade.",
      "output_sha256": "b0e35a21ea4fb6626dad8fb96a542df4339a8804d92849f13abc05cf09c8f971",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.584865,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d024379de5a3aaf7c7bd85b366f3e6c9bea8bf333f6f6a257c062a1b734bafcd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b0e35a21ea4fb6626dad8fb96a542df4339a8804d92849f13abc05cf09c8f971",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    }
  ]
}
